### Get the company's CRM settings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/crm
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Save the company's CRM settings (outcome → pipeline stage, AI employee)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/crm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "aiEmployeeId": 252,
  "meetingBookedStatusId": 15,
  "promiseToPayStatusId": 22,
  "notInterestedStatusId": 19,
  "callbackStatusId": 12,
  "newLeadStatusId": 11
}

### Uysot pipelines and their statuses (for the outcome → stage mapping)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crm/uysot/pipes
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Uysot employees (for aiEmployeeId and manager transfers)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crm/uysot/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Uysot residential complexes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/crm/uysot/houses
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Flats on sale — what the agent's searchFlats tool sees
POST http://localhost:8080/api/crm/uysot/flats/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "rooms": 3,
  "priceTo": 60000,
  "limit": 5
}
